From 49f0a59d4703d643df803f50d438795fd144cf76 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Erhan Bilgili <erhan.bilgili@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 12:48:43 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [hud] Port Wineland HUD features to DXVK Low Latency

Share the Wineland HUD layout, font, hardware telemetry, visibility
control and graphs. Preserve the low-latency HUD items and frame-pacer
integration.

Include the presentation telemetry dependencies, shared clock calibration
and bounded timing-query accounting. The D3D12 HUD bridge works with
Wineland vkd3d-proton. vkd3d-low-latency is unchanged.
